WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — from-ephemeral-inference-to-compiled-agency (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:15.100
<v Narrator>Ọkan, awọn imọ-ẹrọ ti o ga julọ di owo-ori fun gbogbo eniyan nigbati awọn awoṣe neural to lagbara ṣe bi ọna ikẹhin lati wa ni ayika awọn tabili wiwa agbegbe, awọn inṣis wiwa ati awọn solusan deede.

2
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:32.300
<v Narrator>Ninu awọn ohun elo ti o ni agbara giga, bi awọn ẹrọ iṣiṣẹ kọnputa, awọn ayipada ninu awọn ilana ṣiṣe le jẹ ki awọn iṣẹ ṣiṣe ti ara ẹni di alailẹgbẹ, ṣugbọn wọn tun le ṣe iranlọwọ lati mu ilọsiwaju iṣẹ ṣiṣe ti eto naa dara si.

3
00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:44.990
<v Narrator>Ninu awọn ohun elo ti o ni ibatan si imọ-ẹrọ, a lo awọn ọna kika data bii awọn aworan, awọn fidio, awọn ọrọ, ati awọn faili lati ṣe agbekalẹ awọn iṣẹ ṣiṣe ti o rọrun.
